<title>USA: Good Guys Q1 net income falls.</title>
<headline>Good Guys Q1 net income falls.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended December 31:	   1996		    1995</p>
<p> Sales			     $286,565,000	  $306,715,000</p>
<p> Net Income			   1,966,000	     6,728,000</p>
<p> Average Shares		    13,464,000	    13,581,000</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share			 .15		     .50</p>
<p>NOTE: Sales for the first quarter of fiscal 1997 were $286.6 million, down seven percent from $306.7 million in the first quarter of fiscal 1996.  Comparable store sales fell 12 percent from 1996 levels.</p>
</text>
